   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "camping.ctx18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Doable with a bit of prep. Practice pitching the tent at home first, or just pack a big lantern and wing it?",
